{"repositoryId":23885503,"availability":"available","full":"stephenlb/webrtc-sdk","name":"webrtc-sdk","description":"WebRTC Simple Calling API + Mobile SDK - A simplified approach to RTCPeerConnection for mobile and web video calling apps.","category":"Developer tools","language":"JavaScript","stars":868,"forks":275,"created":"2014-09-10T17:58:08Z","updated":"2020-08-26T00:04:06Z","license":"MIT","branch":"master","homepage":"https://stephenlb.github.io/webrtc-sdk/","topics":["webrtc","webrtc-call","webrtc-demo","webrtc-dialing","webrtc-javascript-library","webrtc-phone","webrtc-receiver","webrtc-sdk","webrtc-video"],"demo":"https://stephenlb.github.io/webrtc-sdk/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-18T16:55:38.850Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-18T16:55:38.850Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-18T16:55:38.850Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-18T16:55:38.850Z","stars":868,"forks":275}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["WebRTC SDK Upgraded! ES6, new camera control and 100x less code than v1.","The following demo uses PubNub for signaling to transfer the metadata and establish the peer-to-peer connection. Once the connection is established, the video and voice runs on public Google STUN/TURN servers. Keep in mind, PubNub can provide the signaling for WebRTC, and requires you to combine it with a hosted WebRTC solution. For more detail on what PubNub does, and what PubNub doesn’t do with WebRTC, check out this article:","At PubNub we believe simplicity is essential for our SDK usability. We've taken a simplified approach to WebRTC Peer Connections by creating and easy-to-use SDK for developers. The ideas of simplicity should span all platforms and devices too and that's why we also support Android WebRTC mobile calling with compatibility for iOS native Objective-C based WebRTC SDK. This simple developer WebRTC SDK is powered by PubNub Data Stream Network."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/stephenlb/webrtc-s